From: grok-build-providers-verify <verify@invalid>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 10:07:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 7/9] Show prompt-cycle usage on completed turns

Carry aggregate prompt usage through durable and legacy terminal rails, then enrich the existing completion marker with uncached input/output, throughput, cache reads and writes, hit ratio, context start/end, and trusted complete cost. Preserve legacy, subagent, bash, and non-success marker behavior.
